# Build context is `src` (see docker-compose.yml). Everything below must stay out
# of the image: host bin/obj carry Windows NuGet paths that clobber the restore
# performed inside the container.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# IDE state — .suo and Copilot indices must never reach an image layer.
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Tooling artifacts
**/ruvector.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

# Secrets
**/.env
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12

# Tests are not needed to build the runtime image
**/*Tests/

# Misc
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store
**/*.md
